# Cloudflare Pages custom headers.
#
# Scoped to the background-removal feasibility test page only — it needs
# cross-origin isolation for SharedArrayBuffer (multi-threaded WASM), which
# @imgly/background-removal can use for better performance. Deliberately
# NOT applied site-wide: COEP: require-corp would break any cross-origin
# embed that isn't CORS/CORP-marked (Razorpay checkout, Google Fonts, etc),
# and nothing else on the site needs it. This is an internal/noindex test
# page, not part of the real face-photo flow.
/internal/bg-removal-test/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
